OL,3,GNEWSAUnqualified man struck off for
OL,4,Adoing nursing shifts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who completed 10 shifts at a
OL,7,Fmental health hospital that he was not
OL,8,Fqualified to do has been struck off the
OL,9,Fnursing register.
OL,11,FNana Kwasi Asabre got a job through an
OL,12,Fagency to work the shifts as a
OL,13,Fregistered nurse in June 2022 and July
OL,14,F2022 at Prospect Park Hospital in
OL,15,FReading.
OL,17,FHe was also found to have given
OL,18,Fmedication to a patient without a nurse
OL,19,Fpresent and then left a medication
OL,20,Fcabinet unlocked during a shift on 24
OL,21,FJuly 2022.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
