OL,3,GNEWSAUnqualified man struck off for
OL,4,Adoing nursing shifts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsabre told a Nursing and Midwifery
OL,7,FCouncil (NMC) panel that he "deeply
OL,8,Fregretted" his actions and "the concern
OL,9,Fthey have caused to the profession
OL,10,F[and] the public".
